 * Temporary continuation-trigger entry point.
 *
 * Permanent nightly trigger:
 *   runNFLDailyAnalyticsPipeline
 *
 * Temporary continuation trigger:
 *   continueNFLDailyAnalyticsPipeline
 *
 * Keeping these handlers separate prevents continuation cleanup
 * from deleting the permanent nightly Run trigger.
 */
function continueNFLDailyAnalyticsPipeline() {

